OL,3,GNEWSA'Shoplifting is costing everyone
OL,4,Amoney'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe co-founder of Poundland says
OL,7,Fretailers are facing their biggest
OL,8,Fchallenge from shoplifting in more than
OL,9,Ftwo decades.
OL,11,FWolverhampton-born businessman Steve
OL,12,FSmith estimated the blight was costing
OL,13,FUK businesses #18bn a year, and forcing
OL,14,Fstores to raise prices.
OL,16,FHe witnessed an incident in Birmingham
OL,17,Flast week of a man lifting a sandwich,
OL,18,Fdrink and crisps from Greggs, returning
OL,19,Fto take more after staff challenged
OL,20,Fhim.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
