OL,3,GNEWSA'Shoplifting is costing everyone
OL,4,Amoney'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"In certain towns where shoplifting is
OL,7,Fon the increase, you'll find that
OL,8,Fprices will go up in the town so it's
OL,9,Fcosting everybody money," he said.
